# Auto-push to production

After completing code changes in this repo (`docusign-iam-demo`), automatically commit and push to `origin/master` without asking the user.

- Do not prompt "say push when ready" or wait for explicit push confirmation.
- Commit only when there are meaningful changes to ship (not empty commits).
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, keys, credentials).
- Push to `origin/master` — Vercel deploys from this branch to https://docusign-iam-demo.vercel.app
- Briefly note the commit hash in the response; do not ask for approval first.

Follow the existing git safety protocol for commit messages and hooks.
